BlueSky plugin bridging the BlueSky air traffic simulator to Frequentis's
operation-plan-service. Files BlueSky routes as U-space OperationPlans
(including contingency/alternate plans) and activates authorized plans
by spawning the corresponding simulated flight.

Drop-in plugin: once installed, BlueSky automatically discovers it from
the shared plugin directory. Load it with "PLUGIN LOAD FRQ_OPPLAN" (or
add FRQ_OPPLAN to enabled_plugins in settings.cfg), then use the
FRQACTIVATE stack command to activate a filed plan.
